## Lazy Initialization in Singleton

```java id="lqv1y1"
class Singleton {

    private static Singleton instance;

    private Singleton(){}

    public static Singleton getInstance(){

        if(instance == null){
            instance = new Singleton();
        }

        return instance;
    }

}
```

