</div>
<div>
  <h1>Counter: <span id="counter">0</span></h1>
</div>
```

This is a basic example to demonstrate how you can integrate Redux into a simple HTML and JavaScript project. However, Redux's full power and convenience are more evident in larger applications or those built with frameworks like React.js, where managing complex state becomes more challenging.

